<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for expressing interest in the Master of Arts in Social Technologies program at Arizona State University. The master's in social technologies is a groundbreaking program for students who wish to understand how new technologies relate to social and organizational change and to apply that understanding to help organizations and communities advance their interests. Focused on the increasing prominence of social technologies in nearly every facet of contemporary life, the MAST is an interdisciplinary degree anchored in social, behavioral, cultural and design approaches to this new reality.&nbsp; For more information about the program feel free to review the <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/sites/default/files/files/advising/documents/mast_graduate_handbook_2015-16.pdf">MAST Program Handbook.</a><br><br>Be sure to review our </font><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3"><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B44BICxe1BtdakFBQkZMeFlFMTA/view" target="_blank">application checklist</a> for more information about the application process in an easy to follow format, and peruse our <a href="http://links.asu.edu/kbuqx">sample schedule</a> to explore the flexible curriculum available for both full-time and part-time students. Also, please take a moment to check out our new <a href="http://links.asu.edu/xqkbm">e-magazine</a> and see all the exciting work being done by our faculty and students.<br><br>It's important to find the right fit in graduate school. A great way to learn more about this degree is to register for one of our upcoming information sessions. You can view the dates <a href="http://links.asu.edu/zbtcy">here</a>, then email me to RSVP for any date you plan to attend.<br><br>Kindest regards,<br>Graduate Studies<br><br>New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences<br><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>, West campus <br><a href="mailto: nc.gradstudies@asu.edu">nc.gradstudies@asu.edu</a><br><br><font size="1"><br><font color="#CCCCCC">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></font><i><br></i></font><font color="#CCCCCC" size="1"><i><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="3"></font><br></i></font><br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>